  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.6.0 enriches command metadata and the opt-in help command with simple and detailed built-in formatters, parser-aware generated syntax, configurable lookup errors, custom path search matching, and result ordering. It replaces params aliases with optional IReadOnlyList collections, so existing alias calls must pass explicit collections. It continues the ContentSystem-backed rebuild introduced in 0.2.0; ContentSystem remains outside the public API. This pre-1.0 release is not a drop-in upgrade from earlier package versions.",
